      skos:note "The heading 'Some Other Title That Should Not Win' is a deliberate test assertion: the pipeline must not use the document H1 as the winning slug/id when deriving an identifier from content. Complements Narrative_PipelineSlugDerivation which covers the fallback mechanism." .

